1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,383
The Superpowers repository on GitHub is probably the most comprehensive skill library out there.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:10,841
It covers the entire development workflow — testing, debugging, collaboration, even meta-skills about how to write skills themselves.

3
00:00:10,841 --> 00:00:13,408
What's interesting is how the skills chain together.

4
00:00:13,408 --> 00:00:21,941
You start with brainstorming to figure out what you're building, use git worktrees for isolation, write a plan, execute with test-driven development, get a code review, and then finish the branch.

5
00:00:21,941 --> 00:00:25,783
Each skill is focused on one job, but they flow together into a complete workflow.

